export anchor ChequeStyle:
    number: 122
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Cheque
    idea: The dashboard is a chequebook, where counterfoils hold the numbers, the greeting is a cheque made out to Mara on a wavy security background, and projects are lines in a register.
    base: light
    palette:
        desk: #e9e8e4, the page
        chequeMint: #eef4f2, the start of the security paper gradient
        chequeLilac: #eef0f8, the end of the security paper gradient
        stub: #f7f8f5, counterfoils and table heads
        navyInk: #15233a, text, rules, the current nav item and this week bars
        muted: #4a5568, captions and labels
        securityGreen: #2f6f62, wave lines at 13 percent, headings, meters and the last week hatch
        signatureViolet: #43358a, the primary button, the signature and focus
        green: #1f6a3f, the On track chip with a ticked disc
        amber: #8a4d00, the At risk chip with a triangle
        red: #a01d2b, the Behind chip with a crossed square and the overdue amount
    type:
        Three stacks. Serif is Garamond, Adobe Garamond Pro, EB Garamond,
        Cormorant Garamond, Palatino Linotype, Georgia, serif. Bank is MICR,
        E-13B, Lucida Sans Typewriter, Lucida Console, ui-monospace,
        monospace, set with 0.14 to 0.24em tracking. Labels are Gill Sans,
        Gill Sans MT, Segoe UI, system-ui, sans-serif. Sizes are 32px
        italic serif payee, 20px italic serif amount in words, 34px
        semibold serif stub figures, 26px bold bank amount, 18px bank line,
        18px semibold serif project names and 11 to 15px sans labels.
    layout:
        A plain bank style top row has a guilloche globe mark with
        Brightwork and Team account, sans nav links with the current one in
        a navy block, an underlined italic search, a violet New project
        button, the bell and the italic user name. The chequebook below is a
        white book with four counterfoils stacked in a 270px left column,
        each with a mono counterfoil number, the caption and a big figure,
        split from the cheque by a dashed perforation. The cheque sits on a
        mint to lilac gradient with fine wave lines. It has Brightwork,
        Weekly order to the team lead, date digits on underlines, Good
        morning beside Mara Okafor in large italic on a write on line, a
        boxed red 4 overdue amount with a clock, the words line Four tasks
        are overdue, settle these first, a memo line with the date, a violet
        signature over Authorised, Brightwork, and a bank number line drawn
        with bar glyphs. The project register is a striped table with
        number, name and team, a hatched paid out meter with percent, tasks,
        due date and a status chip. Below, Daily deposits shows hatched
        green bars for last week and solid navy bars for this week, and
        Recent transactions lists activity with times on the right. Below
        980px the counterfoils become a two by two grid above the cheque.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 26 to 30px cheque padding, 12px table cells and 36px before sections.
    density: Medium. One big cheque, then a tidy register and two panels.
    corners: Small, 3 to 4px on the book, panels, buttons and chips.
    borders: 1.5px ink write on lines for payee, words, memo and signature, and a 2px dashed perforation between stubs and cheque.
    shadows: A 2px flat edge and one soft drop under the chequebook.
    icons:
        Solid chips with an outline, a ticked disc for On track, a triangle
        with a mark for At risk and a crossed square for Behind, plus a
        clock for overdue. Bank line symbols are small bar glyphs.
    focus: A 2px violet outline offset 2px with a soft violet halo.
    tone: Banking words, such as The sum of, Counterfoil, Register and Deposits.
